  "construction": {
    "carrier": "FreeGroup Nat",
    "groupTriangle": "s^3(x)=x and x*s^2(x)*s(x)=1",
    "freshStep": "For uncovered a and a new generator g_k with k>0: a -> g_k*a^-1 -> g_k^-1 -> a.",
    "source": "M(x,y)=s^2(x)^-1*y^-1",
    "leftDivision": "L(x,y)=y^-1*s^2(x)^-1",
    "rightDivision": "R(x,y)=s(y^-1*x^-1)",
    "leftSubset": "g_0, plus reduced words whose first letter is negative and last letter positive.",
    "rightSubset": "Reduced words starting with positive g_i, i>0, and ending with negative g_0.",
    "leftGrowth": "On the left subset, |L(x,y)|=|y|+1, so g_0 has no preimage in a row.",
    "rightGrowth": "On the right subset, |R(x,y)|=1+|x|+|y|, so g_1*g_0^-1 has no preimage in a column.",
    "conclusion": "Neither actual division image of E1719, nor of its dual E1888, is equationally definable on arbitrary carriers. The same infinite model has no model-specific reverse multiplication term for either division.",
    "finiteLimitation": "No finite embedding/completion theorem for these controlled triangle patterns was proved; both finite image questions stay open."
  },
